{"3412640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ODYSSEY: Starship Pinball", "steam_appid": 3412640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS PINBALL MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the intrepid Starship captain, Wilbur, on their ridiculous journey through an infinite pinball-inspired world. Each room (or table) draws from classic pinball motifs (with targets, flippers, Multiball, and more) but this retro pinball gameplay has a twist… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room connects to another, procedurally selected from over a dozen handcrafted levels, endlessly. Bump from room to room to play new tables in classic pinball style, unlocking new biomes and astronomical scores the higher you go – forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by pinball classics, like <i>3D Pinball: Space Cadet</i>, plus the physics comedy of <i>Getting Over It</i>, <strong><i>ODYSSEY: Starship Pinball</i></strong> is a next-generation take on the endless arcade format with a roguelite twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUMP ANYWHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flippers aren’t the only way to get around; you can manually bump the ship to thrust Wilbur in any direction and reach new heights. As you explore, you’ll unlock new plunger checkpoints (in case dear Wilbur is lost) for a new intrepid Starship captain to continue the odyssey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZANY PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wilbur hits targets and bumps into walls, their ship takes damage. Inevitably, the ship explodes, setting Wilbur free to tumble through the world, equal parts pinball astronaut and floppy little guy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOW WITH IDLE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet up with Idle Mode and let Wilbur take over, activating flippers, bumping away from peril, and adventuring higher automatically. And if an emergency requires a manual override, you always have control even while Idle Mode is active. Finally, you can rocket your score while working on spreadsheets and scrolling TikTok. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS PINBALL MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/4143081828b8619fd6d87f1859144373.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the intrepid Starship captain, Wilbur, on their ridiculous journey through an infinite pinball-inspired world. Each room (or table) draws from classic pinball motifs (with targets, flippers, Multiball, and more) but this retro pinball gameplay has a twist… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room connects to another, procedurally selected from over a dozen handcrafted levels, endlessly. Bump from room to room to play new tables in classic pinball style, unlocking new biomes and astronomical scores the higher you go – forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by pinball classics, like <i>3D Pinball: Space Cadet</i>, plus the physics comedy of <i>Getting Over It</i>, <strong><i>ODYSSEY: Starship Pinball</i></strong> is a next-generation take on the endless arcade format with a roguelite twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUMP ANYWHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/cad47297efda93c0927932404109bfc8.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flippers aren’t the only way to get around; you can manually bump the ship to thrust Wilbur in any direction and reach new heights. As you explore, you’ll unlock new plunger checkpoints (in case dear Wilbur is lost) for a new intrepid Starship captain to continue the odyssey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZANY PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/c692638ab8d4e6edd70a1cddd1267edf.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wilbur hits targets and bumps into walls, their ship takes damage. Inevitably, the ship explodes, setting Wilbur free to tumble through the world, equal parts pinball astronaut and floppy little guy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOW WITH IDLE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.poster.avif?t=1786999728\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.webm?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/extras/27c760cb59c854d4a56a5ab9b3dc470d.mp4?t=1786999728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet up with Idle Mode and let Wilbur take over, activating flippers, bumping away from peril, and adventuring higher automatically. And if an emergency requires a manual override, you always have control even while Idle Mode is active. Finally, you can rocket your score while working on spreadsheets and scrolling TikTok. </p>", "short_description": "A zany pinball platformer, inspired by classic arcade tables with a procedural twist. Bounce, fling, and bump through a roguelite pinball world in endless singleplayer or idle modes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412640/6a0c8e2a1283cbca53cf9406475ab91566e99138/header.jpg?t=1786999728", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite